<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head reveal">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">WEEKLY SNAPSHOT</view>
      <view class="display" style="margin-top: 6rpx;">最近 7 天</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tag tag--outline" wx:if="{{rangeLabel}}">{{rangeLabel}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-title">正在整理</view>
    <view class="muted">把这 7 天的记录连起来看看…</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card center">
    <view class="empty-title">这次没有生成成功</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin: 12rpx 0 28rpx;">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn--primary" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoRecord">回到记录页</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{blocked}}">
    <view class="card reveal reveal-2">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view class="section-title">还差一点</view>
        <view class="tag tag--gold">{{recordedDays}} / {{requiredDays}} 天</view>
      </view>
      <view class="gate-number">
        <text class="gate-number__value">{{requiredDays - recordedDays}}</text>
        <text class="gate-number__unit">天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">{{message}}</view>
      <view class="progress-track">
        <view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{progress}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="week-dots">
        <view
          wx:for="{{weekDots}}"
          wx:key="date"
          class="week-dot {{item.recorded ? 'is-recorded' : ''}} {{item.isToday ? 'is-today' : ''}}"
        >
          <view class="week-dot__circle">{{item.recorded ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
          <view class="week-dot__label">{{item.label}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card card--tint reveal reveal-3">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view class="section-title">怎么算有效记录</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">同一天只算 1 天。重复提交会更新当天记录，不会增加天数；记录只存在本机。</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn--primary reveal reveal-4" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoRecord">去记录今天</button>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card week-hero reveal reveal-2">
      <view class="row-between">
        <view>
          <view class="section-title">这 7 天你记录了</view>
          <view class="week-big">
            <text class="week-big__value">{{recordedDays}}</text>
            <text class="week-big__unit">天</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="tag {{counterCount > 0 ? 'tag--gold' : 'tag--outline'}}">
          {{counterCount > 0 ? counterCount + ' 个反常识' : '暂无标为反常识'}}
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="week-dots">
        <view
          wx:for="{{weekDots}}"
          wx:key="date"
          class="week-dot {{item.recorded ? 'is-recorded' : ''}} {{item.isToday ? 'is-today' : ''}}"
        >
          <view class="week-dot__circle">{{item.recorded ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
          <view class="week-dot__label">{{item.label}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted small" style="margin-top: 18rpx;">按最近 7 天滚动统计（含今天），不是自然周。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="reveal reveal-3">
      <view class="section-head">
        <view class="section-title">两个可验证的模式</view>
        <view class="section-note">不是性格结论</view>
      </view>

      <view
        wx:for="{{patterns}}"
        wx:key="title"
        class="pattern-card {{item.isCounterIntuitive ? 'pattern-card--counter' : ''}}"
      >
        <view class="pattern-index">0{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="row-between">
          <view class="section-title">PATTERN 0{{index + 1}}</view>
          <view class="tag {{item.isCounterIntuitive ? 'tag--gold' : 'tag--sage'}}">
            {{item.isCounterIntuitive ? '反常识' : '模式'}}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="pattern-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="pattern-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card card--dark reveal reveal-4">
      <view class="row-between">
        <view class="cover-eyebrow">NEXT · MONTHLY</view>
        <view class="tag tag--dark">满 10 天</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pattern-title" style="color: #f8f2e4; padding-right: 0;">把 7 天，拉长成一个月</view>
      <view class="muted" style="color: rgba(248,242,228,.66); margin-bottom: 24rpx;">
        状态分布、Top 2 场景、例外 / 张力，以及一条从记录里长出来的轻量建议。
      </view>
      <button class="btn btn--gold" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onOpenMonthly">查看月角色卡</button>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn--link" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoRecord">补记 / 修改今天</button>
  </block>

  <view class="footer-note">
    每个模式都带数量或日期锚点；「反常识」只是与常见周节奏不同，不是性格结论。
  </view>
</view>
